UPDATE businesses SET description = 'JEM Hair and Beauty Studio is a hair salon at 3-Arts Village on Main Road in Plumstead, Cape Town. Its team of more than 14 practitioners offers hair colouring, highlights, hair treatments and standard hair services, along with lash services, manicures, pedicures and nail services.

