-- kromboom-dental-centre-rondebosch-east (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Kromboom Dental Centre is a dental practice in Rondebosch East, Cape Town, which describes its approach as patient first. Its services include consultations, child-friendly dentistry for patients aged 12 and under, wisdom tooth removal, and fixed and removable orthodontics for adults and children.

The practice offers advanced root canal treatment using a surgical microscope, Philips Zoom tooth whitening, and after-hours emergency care, and it says it uses state-of-the-art equipment. A full list of services is on its website.

